Android’s TYPE_ORIENTATION sensor is deprecated. To get azimuth, pitch, and roll,
combine the TYPE_ACCELEROMETER and TYPE_MAGNETIC_FIELD sensors. Feed their raw data into 
SensorManager.getRotationMatrix(), then pass that matrix into SensorManager.getOrientation()
to get your three angles.

